  "description": "Reid Vantage 3 | Endurance road bike\nHigh-performance components, lightweight construction and adventure-ready versatility – the Reid Bikes Vantage 3 is a premium endurance road bike designed for riders looking to go further and ride faster.\nThe Reid Bikes Vantage 3 combines a double-butted aluminium frame, full carbon fibre fork and Shimano 105 groupset to deliver responsive performance and comfort across longer distances. Its refined endurance geometry provides a balanced riding position, making it suitable for fast road rides, challenging routes and exploring beyond smooth tarmac.\nThe hydroformed aluminium frame features fully integrated cable routing and a 12mm thru-axle for a clean finish and secure handling. Its custom ovalised seatstays are designed to provide additional vertical compliance, helping reduce road vibration and fatigue over longer rides. The full carbon fibre fork further reduces weight while contributing to a more comfortable ride.\nA Shimano 105 12-speed drivetrain delivers precise, reliable shifting across a wide range of gears. The compact 50/34T chainset is paired with an 11-36T cassette, providing versatile gearing for steep climbs, fast descents and varied terrain. Shimano 105 hydraulic disc brakes with 160mm rotors offer powerful, controlled braking in changing weather conditions.\nThe Reid Bikes Vantage 3 features 700c alloy wheels fitted with WTB Exposure 700x30mm tubeless-ready tyres. Designed to offer a balance of rolling efficiency, grip and comfort, the wider tyres provide additional versatility for rougher roads, cobbled streets and hard-packed surfaces.\nFinished with compact alloy drop handlebars, comfortable bar tape and a sport saddle, the Reid Vantage 3 brings together performance road cycling and adventure-ready versatility.\nThe Reid Bikes Vantage 3 is ideal for:\n\nEndurance road cycling, with refined geometry designed for longer days in the saddle\n\nPerformance riding, with a lightweight aluminium frame and Shimano 105 12-speed groupset\n\nClimbing and fast descents, with a compact chainset and wide-range 11-36T cassette\n\nConfident braking, with Shimano 105 hydraulic disc brakes and 160mm rotors\n\nLong-distance comfort, with a full carbon fibre fork and compliance-focused seatstay design\n\nExploring varied road surfaces, with WTB Exposure tubeless-ready tyres and additional grip and comfort",
